<title>INDIA: ICI keeps India Asian Paints firm on BSE.</title>
<headline>ICI keeps India Asian Paints firm on BSE.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Asian Paints India Ltd rallied at the Bombay bourse after its reopen on Tuesday following a four day break.</p>
<p>The price move was catching up with the action on the National Stock Exchange on Monday after British chemicals and paints group ICI Plc said it had purchased a 9.1 percent stake, traders said.</p>
<p>At 11.30 a.m. (0600 GMT), Asian Paints shares were 10.0 rupees, or 3.0 percent, higher at 340.0 at the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE).</p>
